<title>INDONESIA: Lippo Sec EGM approves Lippo Life deal.</title>
<headline>Lippo Sec EGM approves Lippo Life deal.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Lippo Securities approved a company proposal on Friday to buy an additional 27 percent stake in Lippo Life, a company official said.  </p>
<p>Billy Sindoro, a director of Lippo Group, said the proposed acquisition was unanimously approved by voting shareholders.</p>
<p>The purchase, part of a massive restructuring of the Lippo group's financial subsidiaries, will increase Lippo Securities' stake in Lippo Life to 32 percent.</p>
<p>Shareholders of Lippo Life earlier approved a company proposal to buy an additional 40 percent stake in Lippo Bank which will take Lippo Life's stake in Lippo Bank to 45 percent.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
